(7775059, 1292168, 77196, '<td valign="top">
Excellent image. This transcends the man and the background and speaks to oh, so much more. I was trying to figure out what contributes to the effect, and came up with: the man''s expression - appears to be a combination of concern and endurance - care lines, expression, etc; no hands - conveys a sense of being rather than doing, weeds convey a sense of obstacles overcome and being dead, the temporary nature of the obstacles; the buildings seem to indicate past accomplishments; the sky is representative of our world - some clouds, but also some sunshine; the band of light through the lower part of the image helps to keep the eye in the image; the frame of the thistle also communicates obstacles while simultaneously assisting with eye control. I''m sure there''s much more as well. 
<br/>To me, this is not just a picture. It is art. 
<br/></td>', 'Excellent image. This transcends the man and the background and speaks to oh, so much more. I was trying to figure out what contributes to the effect, and came up with: the man''s expression - appears to be a combination of concern and endurance - care lines, expression, etc; no hands - conveys a sense of being rather than doing, weeds convey a sense of obstacles overcome and being dead, the temporary nature of the obstacles; the buildings seem to indicate past accomplishments; the sky is representative of our world - some clouds, but also some sunshine; the band of light through the lower part of the image helps to keep the eye in the image; the frame of the thistle also communicates obstacles while simultaneously assisting with eye control. I''m sure there''s much more as well. 
To me, this is not just a picture. It is art.', '2025-01-15 09:03:34.000000', NULL, 0),
